{"id":"input-dcdca1e95b78","steamAppId":"1061910","name":"Metal: Hellsinger","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/library_600x900.jpg","imageStatus":"downloaded","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061910/","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"partial","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":12.0,"windowsMinimumDisplay":"12 GB"},"verificationStatus":"identified","custom":{},"sourceProfile":{"inputRecordId":"input-dcdca1e95b78","canonicalId":"steam-app-1061910","suppliedName":"Metal: Hellsinger","suppliedImageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/library_600x900.jpg","officialName":"Metal: Hellsinger","aliases":[],"series":null,"franchise":null,"productType":"game","editionName":null,"originalReleaseYear":null,"identifiedVersionReleaseYear":2022,"developers":["The Outsiders"],"publishers":["Funcom"],"platforms":["windows"],"genres":["Action","Adventure"],"shortDescription":"Slay to the rhythm of metal and vengeance on an infernal journey through the eight Hells. Make them fear the beat. Metal: Hellsinger is a rhythm FPS bursting with demons, badass weapons, and heavy metal music.","confusingWith":[],"candidateIdentifiers":{"steamAppId":"1061910"},"sources":[{"label":"Steam Store","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061910/","accessedAt":"2026-10-15T10:44:39.060Z","supports":["officialName","productType","identifiedVersionReleaseYear","developers","publishers","platforms","genres","shortDescription","steamMetadata.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T10:44:39.060Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1061910","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061910/","officialWebsite":"https://www.metalhellsinger.com/","support":"https://www.funcom.com/help/"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":12,"unit":"GB","display":"12 GB","approximateBytes":12000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 12 GB"},"recommended":{"value":15,"unit":"GB","display":"15 GB","approximateBytes":15000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 15 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"partial","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","Adventure"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":18,"description":"Partial Controller Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1061910","steamName":"Metal: Hellsinger","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1061910/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T07:40:42.854934+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Slay to the rhythm of metal and vengeance on an infernal journey through the eight Hells. Make them fear the beat. Metal: Hellsinger is a rhythm FPS bursting with demons, badass weapons, and heavy metal music.","detailedDescription":"Reviews\n\nAbout the Game\n\nPart human, part demon, and bent on vengeance. Become The Unknown, and fight through the fiercest domains of Hell on an infernal ride to face the Red Judge herself. You have a score to settle.\n\nMetal: Hellsinger is a rhythm FPS, where your ability to shoot on the beat will enhance your gameplay experience. The more in sync you are with the rhythm, the more intense the music will become and the more destruction you will cause.\n\nDefeat the demon hordes with your skull-clad blade or range of murderous weaponry. Once your ultimate is ready, unleash havoc with the weapon ability of your choice.\n\nEnter the Leviathan game mode, where you must defeat increasingly challenging waves of demons in hellish arenas. As you progress, make brutal decisions about what upgrades to choose, and forge yourself into a true headbanging machine of death.\n\nEvery track has been created specifically for the game by composer duo Two Feathers, with vocals by metal icons such as Serj Tankian (System of a Down), Randy Blythe (Lamb of God), Alissa White-Gluz (Arch Enemy), and many more!\n\nPlay through an epic storyline, narrated by award-winning actor Troy Baker. Unlock special challenges and conquer the realms of Torment to become more powerful and get a leg up on the leaderboards.\n\nAlthough commonly known as Hell, The Infernal Planes is in reality a union of a thousand Hells, all of which are terrifying and diabolical in their own way. In order to dethrone The Red Judge, you must fight your way through the fiercest corners, from the icy world of Voke to the maddening world of Stygia.\n\nMetal: Hellsinger is created by an experienced FPS team at The Outsiders and is the passion project of David Goldfarb, Game Director on Payday 2 and Lead Designer on Battlefield 3 and Battlefield: Bad Company 2.\n\nDMCA and Copyright Information:\nWe fully own the songs as they are specifically written, produced and performed for the game. For content creators, we have done everything from our side to make sure strikes won't happen.","aboutGame":"Part human, part demon, and bent on vengeance. Become The Unknown, and fight through the fiercest domains of Hell on an infernal ride to face the Red Judge herself. You have a score to settle.\n\nMetal: Hellsinger is a rhythm FPS, where your ability to shoot on the beat will enhance your gameplay experience. The more in sync you are with the rhythm, the more intense the music will become and the more destruction you will cause.\n\nDefeat the demon hordes with your skull-clad blade or range of murderous weaponry. Once your ultimate is ready, unleash havoc with the weapon ability of your choice.\n\nEnter the Leviathan game mode, where you must defeat increasingly challenging waves of demons in hellish arenas. As you progress, make brutal decisions about what upgrades to choose, and forge yourself into a true headbanging machine of death.\n\nEvery track has been created specifically for the game by composer duo Two Feathers, with vocals by metal icons such as Serj Tankian (System of a Down), Randy Blythe (Lamb of God), Alissa White-Gluz (Arch Enemy), and many more!\n\nPlay through an epic storyline, narrated by award-winning actor Troy Baker. Unlock special challenges and conquer the realms of Torment to become more powerful and get a leg up on the leaderboards.\n\nAlthough commonly known as Hell, The Infernal Planes is in reality a union of a thousand Hells, all of which are terrifying and diabolical in their own way. In order to dethrone The Red Judge, you must fight your way through the fiercest corners, from the icy world of Voke to the maddening world of Stygia.\n\nMetal: Hellsinger is created by an experienced FPS team at The Outsiders and is the passion project of David Goldfarb, Game Director on Payday 2 and Lead Designer on Battlefield 3 and Battlefield: Bad Company 2.\n\nDMCA and Copyright Information:\nWe fully own the songs as they are specifically written, produced and performed for the game. For content creators, we have done everything from our side to make sure strikes won't happen."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/header.jpg?t=1788334430"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788334430"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/18814fd779bb9d50915fb1083dd5cfaa.avif?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/d577d92ac466bbd9c98eb1d27a89b3a2.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/d5a2bde328f4778b4271c89073611d08.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/534aeac01ecda5b1cb8d7aad2214d56d.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/4e93b007926fdb2bda3a0956f9d83e16.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/5c44bc10632a44575f788cb588e8fc84.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/9018b44eb6ceb19822f925b0681f25b7.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1061910/extras/89140521301c0e629e747ae189adaef1.webp?t=1788334430","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st